to Las Vegas now Eric Palacios from Eric  Palacios and Associates the sponsors of  this segment shares four things you can  do if you have an accident at work  hi I'm attorney Eric Palacios welcome to  the legal minute today we're going to  answer the question what four things you  should do if you suffer an accident at  work number one inform a supervisor it's  important to immediately tell your  supervisor you had an accident and to  make a list of any co-workers who saw  the accident even if you don't believe  you're hurt let your supervisor know  number two seek medical attention as  soon as possible if you have pain don't  wait days or even weeks to see if you  get better on your own ask to see a  medical provider the sooner the better  number three let the doctor and medical  staff know it was a work injury ask the  staff to fill out the required medical  form this form is called a C4  finally four seek the advice of an  experienced workers comp attorney  immediately if you don't request certain  benefits right away you may lose your  rights or benefits permanently this has  been the legal minute we'll see you next  time  give Eric Palacios and Associates a call  or visit their website at Eric  palacioslaw.com
 

